public void SessionTest() {
    //ordinal返回枚举变量的序号
    for(SeasonEunm seasion:SeasonEunm.values()) {
        System.out.println(seasion+",ordinal:"+seasion.ordinal()+",name:"+seasion.name());
        System.out.println("枚举变量值:"+seasion.getName()+",枚举变量值:"+seasion.getValue());
    }
}
```

输出：
