    <head>  
    <script type="text/javascript" src="jquery.js"></script>  
    <script type="text/javascript">  
    $(document).ready(function(){  
      $("p").click(function(){  
        $(this).hide();  
      });  
    });  
    </script>  
    </head>  

    <body>  
      <p>If you click on me, I will disappear.</p>  
    </body>  

    </html>   
```

如果把$(document).ready(function() {});去掉后，无法隐藏段落：

```html
